{
  "changed": true,
  "repair_type": "OUTLINE",
  "changes": [
    "Added R10 to the submit-job intake step so the scheduler allocates jobs based on submitted job parameters.",
    "Inserted authentication checks for View Job Status and Delete/Change Job, gated by R50 and R59.",
    "Added explicit stop paths after failed authentication in the view and delete/change flows.",
    "Added R88 to the cluster-status update step to cover status updates when a job ends and is removed.",
    "Reworked the stride-scheduling loop as an explicit repeat-until loop with an exit on no jobs left in the queue.",
    "Added a time-slicing action inside the scheduling loop to represent the feature deciding how to time-slice jobs."
  ],
  "rationale": "Outline edited for the selected defects.",
